{"step_index":11,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T02:18:46Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-24T07:48:46+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-24T07:48:50+05:30\nThe search for \"chrome extension ikbkijdgnelcijmdkcaaoabmobagakim prompt engineering\" returned the following summary:\nThe Chrome extension associated with the ID **`ikbkijdgnelcijmdkcaaoabmobagakim`** is named **Promptive Sentry**[1][2].\n\n### What is Promptive Sentry?\nPromptive Sentry is an AI-focused browser extension designed to act as a productivity suite for users who frequently interact with large language models (LLMs) like ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini[1][3].\n\n### Key Features\n*   **Prompt Engineering & Enhancement:** It includes a \"Prompt Enhancer\" feature that can transform vague or simple user inputs into structured, expert-level instructions with a single click[1]. It offers different tone modes (Business, Creative, Technical, and Auto) and refinement controls (Balanced, Conservative, or Radical)[1][4].\n*   **Conversation Context Management:** The extension features \"Sentry Memory,\" which allows you to capture and summarize your conversation context[1][5]. You can save these summaries into a local vault (up to 20 slots) and reload them into new chat sessions to maintain continuity[1][6].\n*   **Usage Tracking:** For Claude users, it provides a \"Claude Token Monitor\" that tracks usage in real-time, helping users stay within their 5-hour and 7-day limits[1][6].\n*   **Privacy-Focused:** The extension is designed with a \"local-first\" approach, meaning saved contexts and user preferences are stored privately on your device[1][4][2].\n\n### How It Works\nRather than providing \"unlimited\" context across different platforms, the tool works by summarizing your conversation, which you can then manually reload or inject into new chats to help the AI \"remember\" previous project details[1][2][6]. This helps bridge the gap created by the \"walled garden\" nature of individual AI chat platforms[2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELdDK1cTSaRFQL36_A-KMJmFFz0ZYnxs8EK54o3OUYoPO6U6fbKWkwsxcXnbIeh1mSPZ-x_3u7JsIdRdlU4DlgSx2cof1trqoV331LF8ovdwEHVmmIyG4GHzTO50gZWuwKy7c5M8Eb3otYtaYUl-WJ4izWbcVYCgXoZFCqq8_aB5R2mq4jC3dmKyFKbIIwAY-N-iT63tiPfWACllHZVXzK)\n[2] [gitconnected.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQz4vX5zDv59auKC7j3uyvEmRg1Zj30gJxrAiRwMZQVgoWYfJi7agKAxZGOmOLrVnzqq103iUFn-59zvEllzNQXG3uepNLu4wurjq8NLb1Jd4KnkE1hAwdynrK6dPI9KQNhE8P5bLWq_q-F1osuqvTlgmblRpe6NMdcU4tEPVBs5-iZZ0zh82m5fkQ4SnnvtfUrueziib_7xX2xeWnAb19QbV45YLJx8FWHacKC8xzx1KriQrUCdpJk3aeAYg=)\n[3] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELdDK1cTSaRFQL36_A-KMJmFFz0ZYnxs8EK54o3OUYoPO6U6fbKWkwsxcXnbIeh1mSPZ-x_3u7JsIdRdlU4DlgSx2cof1trqoV331LF8ovdwEHVmmIyG4GHzTO50gZWuwKy7c5M8Eb3otYtaYUl-WJ4izWbcVYCgXoZFCqq8_aB5R2mq4jC3dmKyFKbIIwAY-N-iT63tiPfWACllHZVXzK)\n[4] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELdDK1cTSaRFQL36_A-KMJmFFz0ZYnxs8EK54o3OUYoPO6U6fbKWkwsxcXnbIeh1mSPZ-x_3u7JsIdRdlU4DlgSx2cof1trqoV331LF8ovdwEHVmmIyG4GHzTO50gZWuwKy7c5M8Eb3otYtaYUl-WJ4izWbcVYCgXoZFCqq8_aB5R2mq4jC3dmKyFKbIIwAY-N-iT63tiPfWACllHZVXzK)\n[5] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELdDK1cTSaRFQL36_A-KMJmFFz0ZYnxs8EK54o3OUYoPO6U6fbKWkwsxcXnbIeh1mSPZ-x_3u7JsIdRdlU4DlgSx2cof1trqoV331LF8ovdwEHVmmIyG4GHzTO50gZWuwKy7c5M8Eb3otYtaYUl-WJ4izWbcVYCgXoZFCqq8_aB5R2mq4jC3dmKyFKbIIwAY-N-iT63tiPfWACllHZVXzK)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGPjPWEJpAFRm-gsRXb-oZlIzBKtxIF4-HGxFeeqfx4WCGMntJXXSKdCqZ3beDpZJBg8j7Ncd-jET5ddd_qVvINfpMQzX0mR-_iAIFySsVz4kyrK-bv4pg8T4HISVfLfA==)"}
