{"step_index":13,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T02:18:56Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-24T07:48:56+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-24T07:49:02+05:30\nThe search for \"Promptive Sentry chrome extension full features prompt enhancer sentry memory context management detailed review\" returned the following summary:\nPromptive Sentry is an \"authoritative AI suite\" designed to enhance productivity across major AI platforms like ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini[1][2]. It functions as a premium productivity layer that helps users manage conversation context, monitor usage, and optimize prompts[2].\n\n### **Core Features**\n\n*   **Sentry Memory (Context Management):**\n    *   **Persistent Context:** Allows you to save your conversation history, project requirements, and custom instructions as a \"structured AI memory\"[3][2].\n    *   **Cross-Session Continuity:** Enables you to reload this saved context into entirely new chat sessions, preventing the need to repeatedly explain your project requirements[1][2].\n    *   **Local Storage:** Uses a 20-slot local vault, keeping your sensitive context data stored privately on your own device[2].\n    *   **Smart Injection:** Instructs the AI model to absorb the reloaded context before it begins responding[2].\n\n*   **Prompt Enhancer:**\n    *   **One-Click Optimization:** Transforms raw, vague inputs into expert-level, well-structured prompts directly within the chat interface[1][2].\n    *   **Refinement Controls:** Offers various modes (Business, Creative, Technical, and Auto) and refinement levels (Balanced, Conservative, or Radical) to ensure the output aligns with your intent[2].\n\n*   **Claude Token Monitor:**\n    *   **Real-Time Tracking:** Monitors your Claude usage limits in real-time, providing visibility into remaining tokens[1][2].\n    *   **Usage Pacing:** Helps you manage workflows to avoid mid-conversation cutoffs or hitting usage caps unexpectedly[4][2].\n\n### **Additional Information**\n\n*   **Platform Support:** The extension is designed to work across major AI web interfaces (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)[1][2]. There is also a version of **Promptive Sentry for IDEs** (e.g., VS Code, Cursor, Windsurf) that focuses on code-specific context like imports, stack traces, and git history[5][6].\n*   **Privacy & Security:** The extension emphasizes a \"local-first\" approach, storing preferences and saved contexts on your local device rather than a cloud server[2].\n*   **User Feedback:** Users have noted that the tool feels like a native IDE feature and appreciate the \"diff view\" in the IDE version, which allows them to see exactly how their prompts are being upgraded before applying them[5][7].\n\n***Note on Confusion:** Be aware that there are other security-focused tools with similar names (such as \"PromptSentry\"), which are primarily designed to block sensitive data from being sent to AI models[8]. Ensure you are installing the version of Promptive Sentry that matches your intended use case (productivity/memory vs. privacy/data masking)[2][8].*\n\nSources:\n[1] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFDkptmYMraYkK_bS5h2Sb-i3pktdvugF4Cs-Nz73Ls1tV8E9-7JLWbSVGcrbiU9p9O-o1xFUxaA6t1itBkPq8RgARzpOrSUtcuJ-_-LAeLvUlLsT4J2J32oxgW4ktDOm9EIfZlBG0XTSpGXpL5FtRjHxxLS1SjaAi35F4a6-cOggV00dCWS6KdWhmxRs2MXJ-OI_c6sTl6Iq2kLyHpAvVjYw==)\n[2] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFDkptmYMraYkK_bS5h2Sb-i3pktdvugF4Cs-Nz73Ls1tV8E9-7JLWbSVGcrbiU9p9O-o1xFUxaA6t1itBkPq8RgARzpOrSUtcuJ-_-LAeLvUlLsT4J2J32oxgW4ktDOm9EIfZlBG0XTSpGXpL5FtRjHxxLS1SjaAi35F4a6-cOggV00dCWS6KdWhmxRs2MXJ-OI_c6sTl6Iq2kLyHpAvVjYw==)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQbYu2QCCL3W09Y5bEZ3J6qV91dkVaFbzph5b4XeT9YxXvD6YgiekypnIYzRQ-8FWLRXrL-K9GD7BHgDuAD23Ag3grhhFJg8NvmzoWy7Pfg6mahotFwEAYhwdlQNypeWg=)\n[4] [mozilla.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.googl