{"step_index":14,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T02:18:57Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-24T07:48:57+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-24T07:49:08+05:30\nThe search for \"\"Promptive Sentry\" prompt engineering features tone modes refinement controls claude token monitor\" returned the following summary:\n**Promptive Sentry** is a browser extension designed to enhance AI workflows—specifically for platforms like Claude, ChatGPT, and Gemini—by providing tools for context management, usage monitoring, and prompt engineering[1][2][3].\n\n### Key Features\n\n*   **Sentry Memory (Context Management):** This feature captures your current conversation and creates an AI-generated summary of the essential context[1][2]. You can save this in a local vault (up to 20 slots) and reload it into new sessions or different AI models, allowing you to bypass the need to re-explain projects[2][4][3].\n*   **Claude Token Monitor:** This provides real-time tracking of your usage limits directly within the Claude interface[2][5]. It monitors both 5-hour and 7-day usage windows and offers \"dynamic pacing guidance\" to help you avoid hitting rate limits unexpectedly[2][6].\n*   **Prompt Enhancer:** A tool designed to transform raw or vague prompts into professional, expert-level instructions[2][5]. \n    *   **Tone Modes:** Includes specific modes such as **Business, Creative, Technical, and Auto**[2][7].\n    *   **Refinement Controls:** Offers levels of adjustment including **Balanced, Conservative, or Radical** to control how much the AI modifies your original input[2][7].\n\n### Privacy & Architecture\nThe extension is built with a **local-first** philosophy, meaning saved contexts and user preferences are stored privately on your device rather than on an external server[2][7].\n\n### Variations\nIt is important to distinguish between the two versions of the tool:\n1.  **Browser Extension:** The Chrome extension described above, which is designed for use in AI web interfaces (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini)[1][2].\n2.  **IDE Extension:** There is also a version for developers (\"Promptive Sentry for IDE\") that works as a VS Code extension[8][9]. This version focuses on injecting \"7-layer editor context\" (such as git history, terminal output, and active file imports) directly into prompts to assist with coding tasks[8][9].\n\nSources:\n[1] [gitconnected.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG7glBgQhTJVmqZrxh_RpjTIeDcQW4-D3ldUaB1fRDkbEtxoncKSPzNNlUFqucsZVhuL6L_HuHLqTmRYkMpPxBNLW-MuWBy-swKy3DF2wQDkDGiAy7nx65lX8dYeIiDfPBDOFVXbladbFQmuFhUBwP_YPgNlkTPBZq0RKXCle-bgriLU3DMc60jv1ndZ2ILZvDufpTWVCi-QLuTeCSuhu4grRAU18zjBMjx5NYUmOYICLIMswW6Z-PZJIcYZXzk)\n[2] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG17yNeedHOynbYVKnxpzeJhx0WT0D5pEvLevdS616kU1fEOUbXeEuka9vlvFeYRI5-8EYZyTzvQJiAkD6YMaqFwSPR9Y1m2kj8MfXsROvoJN2lpb3i6bGBuCCt3J3y8Gk-wxqwx2DBmg392hhzWleShsVql_Ne0Z4XksEpKEnFvf6Y7gvUd6KynDAdW4d8NG_Ib3CKUnh8LXY_KfMUiL6Mzw==)\n[3] [gitconnected.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG7glBgQhTJVmqZrxh_RpjTIeDcQW4-D3ldUaB1fRDkbEtxoncKSPzNNlUFqucsZVhuL6L_HuHLqTmRYkMpPxBNLW-MuWBy-swKy3DF2wQDkDGiAy7nx65lX8dYeIiDfPBDOFVXbladbFQmuFhUBwP_YPgNlkTPBZq0RKXCle-bgriLU3DMc60jv1ndZ2ILZvDufpTWVCi-QLuTeCSuhu4grRAU18zjBMjx5NYUmOYICLIMswW6Z-PZJIcYZXzk)\n[4] [facebook.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEaYx6VcqeTBbcW3by-kBJ1vpMjiL8knl4MZE51p8bzKqxbSsZJqDRU-mC92t0hVVnrEPXjj8pEuEFs5o7INISKy25eQ8ZaseUt-Bh5cz6K56-PyGTY73poi5GOLK4=)\n[5] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG17yNeedHOynbYVKnxpzeJhx0WT0D5pEvLevdS616kU1fEOUbXeEuka9vlvFeYRI5-8EYZyTzvQJiAkD6YMaqFwSPR9Y1m2kj8MfXsROvoJN2lpb3i6bGBuCCt3J3y8Gk-wxqwx2DBmg392hhzWleShsVql_Ne0Z4XksEpKEnFvf6Y7gvUd6KynDAdW4d8NG_Ib3CKUnh8LXY_KfMUiL6Mzw==)\n[6] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirec