{"step_index":16,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T02:19:15Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-24T07:49:15+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-24T07:49:20+05:30\nThe search for \"\"Promptive Sentry\" IDE extension \"7-layer\" context git history prompt diff view code context injection\" returned the following summary:\n**Promptive Sentry** is a professional-grade, context-aware IDE extension designed to transform developer intent into production-ready prompts by automatically injecting comprehensive editor context[1][2].\n\n### Key Features\n*   **7-Layer Context Engine:** To ensure AI responses are highly precise, the extension automatically collects and injects seven layers of real-time editor data[1][3]:\n    1.  **Active File:** Current content (up to 300 lines around the cursor) with role inference[1][3].\n    2.  **Full Imports:** All internal and external dependencies[1][3].\n    3.  **Open Tabs:** All currently open files, including language and unsaved state[1][3].\n    4.  **Terminal Output:** Recent history captured via Shell Integration[1][3].\n    5.  **Stack Trace:** Auto-detected errors and crashes from terminal output[1][3].\n    6.  **Git Context:** Current branch, recent commits, and active file diff[1][3].\n    7.  **Tech Stack:** Detected framework, runtime, test runner, and monorepo structure[3].\n\n*   **Native Diff Review:** After upgrading a prompt, the extension integrates with your IDE’s native diffing tool, allowing you to compare the original and upgraded versions side-by-side to accept or revert changes easily[1][4].\n*   **Zero-Knowledge Architecture:** The extension is designed with privacy in mind, utilizing a hardened backend proxy for LLM processing. It does not require local API keys[1][4].\n*   **Universal Compatibility:** Built on the VS Code extension standard, it works natively across editors including VS Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Antigravity, Warp, Kiro, and VSCodium[1][5].\n\n### How It Works\n1.  **Trigger:** Select or write a prompt in your editor and trigger the upgrade (default command: `Cmd+Shift+U` on Mac or `Ctrl+Shift+U` on Windows)[6].\n2.  **Injection:** The Universal AI Context Engine silently gathers the 7 layers of context in parallel and packages them for the AI[1][3].\n3.  **Review:** Use the IDE's native diff view to audit the AI's \"upgraded\" prompt before accepting it[5][6].\n\nPromptive Sentry was developed by **Xenriq Systems** as part of their infrastructure-grade AI tools for developers[7][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [open-vsx.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdW9PSSXqoeSXvIjBnHwATHh2-lr_P2dGogY8IoPxvEm8ARDJjEtqcJ6BgecZmmPEV47cbDB1PIOEqSloQFmw8biM94bl3LMqm12FQyqyvqxOXV852-nUYy0BSxTEK9roS02Hs87skhl8SkR-rIB8f)\n[2] [open-vsx.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdW9PSSXqoeSXvIjBnHwATHh2-lr_P2dGogY8IoPxvEm8ARDJjEtqcJ6BgecZmmPEV47cbDB1PIOEqSloQFmw8biM94bl3LMqm12FQyqyvqxOXV852-nUYy0BSxTEK9roS02Hs87skhl8SkR-rIB8f)\n[3] [open-vsx.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdW9PSSXqoeSXvIjBnHwATHh2-lr_P2dGogY8IoPxvEm8ARDJjEtqcJ6BgecZmmPEV47cbDB1PIOEqSloQFmw8biM94bl3LMqm12FQyqyvqxOXV852-nUYy0BSxTEK9roS02Hs87skhl8SkR-rIB8f)\n[4] [open-vsx.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGDRZBLql9Nzn-9pDTUzsyDW2-pbohSEy_2RHElD72n-f9bmKMn11Fp_pEGUN1P1FNLvDddUPlibwclXboJ03mf9wmtdBDCYWuIRjVmiuzTH1Px4rAjwfn7Uum3bxv6lx0-5FGAtsaqv6fR-NE_YVO4Q9fcrTEPjvA=)\n[5] [open-vsx.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTQV_tK6pxLhObx69AJyEaLT5YI2CJhfOpq3GmegEFirsb5im9mx5OdjUG8rl56eGxLHwypp1VYsD0VsJPuqqf2vjS13TQg9d3cRDUUNt50jRFrC8sx-rUKFCqM2ExjGeTm57TwhdF2DlxNSroSu1avfefckaQLM0=)\n[6] [open-vsx.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdW9PSSXqoeSXvIjBnHwATHh2-lr_P2dGogY8IoPxvEm8ARDJjEtqcJ6BgecZmmPEV47cbDB1PIOEqSloQFmw8biM94bl3LMqm12FQyqyvqxOXV852-nUYy0BSxTEK9roS02Hs87skh